  "2026-11-10T12:15:59.169Z",codex-agent,"CI log inspection refines the reported failure: Node 22 npm has the 75.365 s preparation test unhandledRejection at the 30 s writer limit. Node 26 npm and Bun each pass all 746 tests but fail 100% branch coverage at 99.77%; uncovered typed-error preservation branches are embeddings.ts:125, portable-ownership.ts:266, portable-plan.ts:29,145, transfer.ts:336, utility.ts:71, verify.ts:171. Isolated local preparation test before changes passes 1/1 in 92.898 s; instrumented Node 22 import holds the lease 2.404 s versus main code 1.873 s with the same installed SDK. Profiling and coverage-mode measurements continue; no lock or test budget changes."
